<title>JAPAN: Nihon Plast - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nihon Plast - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 24.77		vs	   27.39</p>
<p> Operating	  416 million	 vs	  827 million</p>
<p> Current	    595 million	 vs	  853 million</p>
<p> Net		  348 million	 vs	  409 million</p>
<p> EPS		   24.19 yen	  vs	   28.43 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     14 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nihon Plast Co Ltd is a manufacturer of synthetic resin parts for cars.</p>
</text>
